<SPT><TTL>QUALITY ASSURANCE</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<SPT><TTL><SUB>Switchgear Drawings</SUB></TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Furnish drawings that include, but are not limited to, the following:</TXT><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
<OLI>Overall dimensions, weights, plan view, and front view</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
