<BRK/></SPT>
</SPT>[<SPT><TTL><SUB>CYBERSECURITY</SUB></TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  If the equipment will have SCADA or any remote control system capability, this paragraph must be included 
and the Designer of Record must coordinate with the activity to determine the required Service Implementation 
Policy.  Add the requirements into this specification.</NPR><BRK/>
